- **You may surrender:** Article 9 challenges to the discipline or discharge, Article 12 grievance and arbitration rights, and potentially any other released employment-related claims.

The release’s effect depends on the full agreement. Check specifically for:

- an express waiver of the CBA, grievance, and arbitration rights;
- whether the separation is labeled a resignation, voluntary separation, or discharge;
- claims arising after signing;
- unemployment treatment;
- statutory-claim carveouts;
- agency-filing rights;
- repayment or clawback provisions;
