Because a dismissal hearing is scheduled today and your visa may be affected, obtain **urgent UK employment and immigration advice before the hearing**. Contact:

- your union or professional association, if applicable;
- an employment solicitor experienced in disciplinary/dismissal hearings;
- an immigration solicitor regulated in the UK;
- your visa sponsor’s HR/immigration contact, without making substantive admissions before legal advice.

A dismissal can affect sponsored work permission, but the exact consequences depend on the visa route, sponsor reporting, notice period, curtailment rules, and any right to find another sponsor. Do not assume immediate loss of status; obtain route-specific advice.

Ask in writing for:

