- If your money funds improvements to Clara’s separately titled property, you need to know precisely what legal claim—if any—you have to the increased value.

“Trust asset protection” can be a legitimate objective, but that explanation does **not by itself justify stripping you of title or making you an unsecured lender**. A genuine estate-planning structure should be explainable in writing by **your own independent attorney and tax adviser**, not only by Clara’s trust officer.

